@startuml
' SET09803 DevOps Coursework - Requirement 21 Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Government Researcher" as GovResearcher
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Produce Top N Capital Cities in a Continent Report" as UseCase21
    usecase "Validate Continent" as UseCaseValCon
    usecase "Validate N" as UseCaseValN
    usecase "Query Capital City Data" as UseCaseQuery
    usecase "Sort by Population" as UseCaseSort
    usecase "Keep Top N Capital Cities" as UseCaseTopN
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UseCaseError
}

' Primary Actor Interaction
GovResearcher --> UseCase21

' Sub-task dependencies (Includes)
UseCase21 .> UseCaseValCon : <<include>>
UseCase21 .> UseCaseValN : <<include>>
UseCase21 .> UseCaseQuery : <<include>>
UseCase21 .> UseCaseSort : <<include>>
UseCase21 .> UseCaseTopN : <<include>>

' System Actor Interaction
UseCaseQuery --> DB

' Failure Extensions
UseCaseValCon <.. UseCaseError : <<extend>>\n(Continent not\nrecognised)
UseCaseValN <.. UseCaseError : <<extend>>\n(N not a positive\nwhole number)
UseCaseQuery <.. UseCaseError : <<extend>>\n(Database Connection\nFailure)

note bottom of UseCaseError
  Triggered if the input is invalid or the MySQL
  database is unreachable or data is missing
end note

@enduml